page 800 12230
block html 0 0 800 12230
  block body 8 8 784 12206
    block h1 8 8 784 40
      line 8 8 784 40 base 28
        text "General Computer Textfiles" 8 12 344 32 serif 32 bold
    block p 8 69 784 100
      line 8 69 784 20 base 14
        text "Your one-stop shop for all files of a \"computery\" nature, that cover how to rebuild a piece of computer hardware to do" 8 71 760 16 serif 16
      line 8 89 784 20 base 14
        text "something it was never meant to do, or to see someone go really deeply into a computing subject that would cause most" 8 91 784 16 serif 16
      line 8 109 784 20 base 14
        text "people to yawn and look for the snack table. Since BBSes were on computers, it was natural for people who used BBSes" 8 111 776 16 serif 16
      line 8 129 784 20 base 14
        text "to focus on all aspects of these wonderful machines. The evidence of their interest and their experimentation resides" 8 131 756 16 serif 16
      line 8 149 784 20 base 14
        text "below." 8 151 44 16 serif 16
    block p 8 185 784 60
      line 8 185 784 20 base 14
        text "Of course, nearly ALL textfiles are computer-related in some fashion, and some subjects might fit here but fit even better" 8 187 776 16 serif 16
      line 8 205 784 20 base 14
        span a 488 207 84 16 link 0
        span a 604 207 36 16 link 1
        text "in another section. For example, you should most definitely check out the " 8 207 480 16 serif 16
        text "programming" 488 207 84 16 serif 16 underline link 0
        text " and " 572 207 32 16 serif 16
        text "apple" 604 207 36 16 serif 16 underline link 1
        text " sections as well, as" 640 207 136 16 serif 16
      line 8 225 784 20 base 14
        text "you might not agree with what I decided should go where." 8 227 380 16 serif 16
